menu "Phone example"
    config PHONE_SD_CARD_MOUNT
        bool "Mount the microSD card at boot"
        default y
        help
            Mounts the card at the BSP mount point (/sdcard by default) in a background task.
            A card that cannot be mounted is reported as missing; it is never formatted.
            The slot has no card detect pin, so a card inserted later needs a restart.
endmenu
